  "description": "Compile-time mocking for .NET using Roslyn source generators. Add [Mock(typeof(IFoo))] to a partial class — AutoMock generates a plain, debuggable test double with per-member Handler delegates and call-tracking, at build time. Zero reflection, zero dynamic proxies, fully AOT/trim-safe — a compile-time alternative to Moq/NSubstitute for interfaces.",
