  "published": "2026-09-20T12:17:28.35Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0: Argument matchers — It.IsAny<T>(), It.Is<T>(predicate), It.IsNotNull<T>() for use with a new {Method}_Verify(Times, params object?[] matchers) overload, e.g. mock.Add_Verify(Times.Once(), It.IsAny<int>(), 2). 1.2.0: Moq-style verification — Times.Once()/Never()/Exactly(n)/AtLeast(n)/AtMost(n)/Between(min,max), generated {Method}_Verify(Times) and {Property}_VerifyGet/VerifySet(Times) methods, throwing AutoMockVerificationException on mismatch. 1.1.0: ref/out/in parameter support (generates a dedicated per-method delegate type when Func/Action can't express the signature); *_WasCalled shorthand per method; AutoMock_Reset() clears every Handler/Calls/property backing field so a mock instance can be reused across tests. 1.0.0: Initial release. [Mock(typeof(IFoo))] on a partial class generates a test double implementing the interface with per-member `*_Handler` delegates, `*_Calls` argument logs, and `*_CallCount`. Supports methods (sync, Task, Task<T>) and get/set properties. AM001 (target must be partial), AM002 (argument must be an interface type), AM003 (unsupported member: generic method, indexer, or event — skipped).",
